\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/4KMtyVMUavRXZ272lzibYsibKxZL7j4OZs6MQsys2WNcCfqf5y1U9TK0cvQqiaBcGgDJcPCKZe5Xibgtve45MiaMVTVMpzicgK0wCGGa2bwQRGtOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VPGjTgxYBiaWRhrQcRQ1CujhVGfjwkd63cBfUDNKhukR3sOSN1sRmKibyUfQZk79JH7dnXs3l7F9x98NKqNTZNu4IrovORZnmWt17FNxu6q5g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VPGjTgxYBiaWRhrQcRQ1CujhVGfjwkd63cBfUDNKhukR3sOSN1sRmKibyUfQZk79JH7dnXs3l7F9x98NKqNTZNu4IrovORZnmWt17FNxu6q5g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>“南京大学接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统”登录端口位于南京大学研究生院主页底部“信息系统”导航栏内，网址为：</span></p><p><strong><span><span>https://gs.nju.edu.cn/geapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span></span><span>以下简称“南大推免系统”），选择</span><strong><span><span>“推免预报名”</span></span></strong><span>系统进入。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>有意申报中美中心2027年推荐免试研究生的同学，必须</span><strong><span><span>通过南大推免系统预报名成功</span></span></strong><span>，才可获得</span><strong><span><span>中心遴选或复试资格</span></span></strong><span>；如未通过南大推免系统预报名，将被视为无效申请。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>3</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人在南大推免系统报名后，请及时查询申请状态或咨询相关报考单位，如收到参加复试通知，请复试时将以下材料提交至相关报考单位：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（1）在南大推免系统报名后下载打印</span><strong><span><span>《南京大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》</span></span></strong><span>，由申请人所在学校教务处盖章。因所在学校教务处工作原因而暂时无法盖章的，可先由申请人所在学校院系盖章，后期补交教务处同意推荐的证明，否则申请无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（2）其他证明自己学术水平和研究能力的</span><strong><span><span>代表性成果</span></span></strong><span>，包括但不限于以下内容（A4 纸规格）：</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>a.本科阶段成绩单复印件（加盖所在学校教务处或院系公章）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>b.外语能力证明材料</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>c.参加各类科研活动的获奖证书复印件</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>d.在公开发行的刊物或全国会议上发表的学术论文、出版物、科技专利证书等复印件，其他代表性成果证明材料等</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（3）</span><strong><span><span>身份证</span></span></strong><span>复印件</span></p><p><span>（4）</span><strong><span><span>学生证</span></span></strong><span>复印件</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>4</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>教育部预计将在</span><strong><span><span>2026年9月下旬</span></span></strong><span>开通“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（开通时间详见中国研招网公告，网址：</span><strong><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn</span></span></strong><span>，以下简称“教育部推免系统”）。通过中美中心选拔并取得所在学校推免资格的学生，仍须在教育部推免系统中进行报名，完成后续相关录取程序，否则申请视为无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>5</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为保证及时接收到后续环节安排通知及信息，</span><strong><span><span>请申请人确保自己</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>邮箱电话填写准确</span></span></strong><span>。请考生及时主动关注</span><strong><span><span>推免预报名系统</span></span></strong><span>、南京大学研究生</span><strong><span><span>招生信息网</span></span></strong><span>、南京大学研究生招生微信公众号</span><strong><span><span>“南大研招”</span></span></strong><span>及</span><strong><span><span>中美中心发布的后续各类通知</span></span></strong><span>，跟进后续各项工作进展。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系邮箱：nxh@nju.edu.cn</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibCm4CvTS25CwlSX7QSqictpFx7PpFPfblkZzEJywgNARWhtgyhyibdHEwhcxGKrJlNCibOibXibSMRV8WkYyAeK4bgibcRorVYXjibVx0k3qsqFWkk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/4KMtyVMUavRsPcLa8gadI5lpc6dn1OJf43hz3KGesoUKg6xILPMDHicAxbk1ptXhmnU1KEIVhgfGPNYYYtOQ5oxyrm1DQUj5dpwicI3O848Rw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>HNC </span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/4KMtyVMUavSzL0Niax4iaOO8vYibT61cglibqRibT5SzwmlsUMbhXjbcwRgHS13iasTQ90wojibgMMAMgHehTAYRLm5VCAujPibpH3b3pttdoSmwXT0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4KMtyVMUavT96GXpsAobiauIFM6k9hCib57L8mpGniavAoDmySKw4cbhtg89Dt5U9bBN5qmHbdVVLWMXFdribRoGtUq760spL5OgVnRib7S9WB80/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>南京大学-约翰斯·霍普金斯大学</span></p><p><span>中美文化研究中心</span></p><p><span>The Johns Hopkins University-Nanjing University</span></p><p><span> Center for Chinese and American Studies</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>图文：中美中心</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编：秦亦阳</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>欢迎关注中美中心微信公众号和B站！</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/4KMtyVMUavTUT2LQ0CACF4xxYhZX3DMOCE3LofSuZPnB2fQTasoFgvW1ZYdA3DcE6Ns07zibj6iaJ73G2XW35nHog2AAVibU4ELRc6oNzm7B48/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f16020c27ba4b448b056d67838135db72d66c4b3ef6a7b76fe0826bfa54328da","textLength":1094,"sourceSha256":"82f26a8aa71cb49173717012c851c7f8c2e04fa825095be3e1a078598583720b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fb1e531d783fa4b72306","title":"2026年南京大学中美文化研究中心2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:20.835697+00:00"}
